There was a wonderful response to the call to help finish
tweaking the Mac port.  There are five people in the Mac group
now, and there is no need for more volunteers.  Thanks for the
response.

The situation is different with the Amiga.  Olaf (who ported the
game to the Amiga) cannot be reached.  We strongly suspect that
the Amiga port needs some adjustments to fit the recent patches,
but no one on the development team uses an Amiga.  So, this is a
call for two-three volunteers who have the needed knowledge and
experience to help adjust the Amiga port to the current code.
Please contact me directly.  Thanks.

--Izchak

p.s.  If anyone has Olaf's current email address, please forward it
